{"name":"-31-1B2-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_NightOPS","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"background","value":"167","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Three hours flew by, and the sun has sank completely beneath the horizon. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Outside the military camp, below a certain unassuming manhole cover."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AR-15, I'm at the designated location.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why did you take so long...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I might have... Nyet, it's nothing. I took a detour because I didn't want to be followed.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Well, whatever. All that matters is that you came.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...I've been keeping watch for three hours now, and neither the signal source inside the base nor the military forces here have made any abnormal moves.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This might just be a backup unit. If only we could hack the systems here and conduct electronic surveillance...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, if AK-12 was here instead, she'd probably be able to do a better job.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Don't say that sort of thing.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...I'll sneak in again once it's dark. Help me keep an eye on the movement of personnel in and out of the base.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Understood.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Wait...!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Danger","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hm? What's wrong?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Something doesn't feel right...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Something doesn't feel right? Let me do a scan... A vehicle has started up, it's a jeep. But it's not emitting any signals with White Faction characteristics.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AN94","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nyet... that can't be it. There's something wrong with that vehicle, we have to catch up to it right now!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"W-Wait... Aren't you going to discuss this with Ange first?!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"94! AN-94! I can't believe she just ran out on her own like that!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"sfx","value":"RunStep","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AR-15 has no choice but to abandon her hiding place to chase after AN-94."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"168","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"}],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dammit!"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Ange, do you read me?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I read you. What's the matter, why are you broadcasting in clear?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AN-94 ran off by herself to chase a military vehicle, I can't establish a secure channel by myself!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Something's wrong with her, I'm doing my best to catch up with her in case something happens!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So we've sighted the big one at last.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The big one?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"94's instincts have always been very accurate. There must be some important clue on that vehicle.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If she's chasing it in such a hurry, then it's very likely that the vehicle's headed straight to the base where the \"Node\" is being kept.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That doesn't mean she had to run off on her own... I'll catch up and follow the vehicle with her.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If we do find the \"Node\", should we destroy it immediately?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What on earth could it be...?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't need to know. The moment you find something like it, wait for my order and destroy it on the spot.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Understood.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This channel isn't secure. I'll find some way to contact you after I catch up with AN-94.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Acknowledged.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'll be waiting for the two of you to contact me again, AR-15.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]}]}
